1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,213
A phenol has an O H directly on an aromatic ring, general formula A r O H.

2
00:00:07,213 --> 00:00:14,531
Do not confuse it with an aromatic alcohol like benzyl alcohol, where the O H is on a side chain carbon.

3
00:00:14,531 --> 00:00:18,945
Benzyl alcohol behaves like an ordinary primary alcohol.

